@startuml
title Commenting Sequence Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User
participant "Angular Feed/Post View" as Frontend
participant "Security Filter" as Security
participant "CommentController" as CommentController
participant "CommentService" as CommentService
participant "PostRepository" as PostRepository
participant "CommentRepository" as CommentRepository
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
database "MySQL" as MySQL

User -> Frontend: Write and submit comment
Frontend -> Security: POST /posts/{postId}/comments
Security -> Security: Validate Bearer JWT

alt Token invalid or expired
  Security --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
  Frontend --> User: Redirect to login
else Token valid
  Security -> CommentController: Authenticated create comment request
  CommentController -> CommentService: createComment(postId, request, currentUser)
  CommentService -> PostRepository: findById(postId)
  PostRepository -> MySQL: Query posts
  MySQL --> PostRepository: Post or empty

  alt Post missing or unavailable
    CommentService --> CommentController: not found/access error
    CommentController --> Frontend: 404 Not Found
    Frontend --> User: Show post unavailable
  else Post available
    CommentService -> CommentService: Validate content and parent comment
    CommentService -> CommentRepository: save(comment)
    CommentRepository -> MySQL: Insert comments row
    MySQL --> CommentRepository: Saved comment
    CommentService -> PostRepository: Increment comment count
    PostRepository -> MySQL: Update posts.comment_count
    CommentService -> NotificationService: Create comment notification
    NotificationService -> MySQL: Insert notifications row
    CommentService --> CommentController: Comment response
    CommentController --> Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend --> User: Display new comment
  end
end

@enduml
